    </div>
    <p>WasteScope reads the pile the way a scrap buyer would at first glance: what's in it, roughly how much, and what that's worth today.</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="steps-3">
    <li class="step">
      <div class="step-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="sv-photo" style="background-image:url('/img/wastescope/aluminium.jpg')"></div>
        <div class="sv-scrim"></div>
        <div class="sv-corners"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
